{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122692","id":4331503291,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAi1-uw","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122692","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122692.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122692.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122692","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122692/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122692/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122692/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/017fe9089ed300313849c628aef3620fde9c8d4a","number":122692,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"iOS - Metal Shader Baking compilation fix / Update rendering_shader_container_metal.cpp","user":{"login":"ernzo","id":5151357,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNTEzNTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5151357?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo","html_url":"https://github.com/ernzo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"We've been revising the implementation with Claude AI, and it's possible it found and Fixed the root cause of:\r\n\r\n> Metal Shader Baking limited to SPIR-V: Unable to determine toolchain properties on iOS export.\r\n\r\n-Two bugs on the same line in drivers/metal/rendering_shader_container_metal.cpp:81\r\n\r\n```\r\n// BROKEN — escaped quotes become literal characters in the shell pattern, \r\n// AND the unquoted | is interpreted as a second pipe by sh -c \r\nparts.append_array({ \"-\", \"|\", \"grep\", \"-E\", R\"(\\\"__METAL_VERSION__|__ENVIRONMENT_OS\\\")\" });\r\n\r\n// FIXED\r\nparts.append_array({ \"-\", \"|\", \"grep\", \"-E\", \"'__METAL_VERSION__|__ENVIRONMENT_OS'\" });\r\n```\r\n\r\nAlso requires to install the MetalToolchain (not installed by default):\r\nxcodebuild -downloadComponent MetalToolchain`\r\n\r\n-With both fixes applied, the Export Warning disappears, \r\nShader Baker step completes and .metallib compilation runs at export time.\r\n\r\nIOW No more SPIR-V warning message;\r\nand the shader compilation step can be seen in Godot export.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097519,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1MTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:ios","name":"platform:ios","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":410064485,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0MTAw